  "descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "This component houses Structural Stability Science (SSS) deployment and authorization records governing access surfaces, Vault materials, training pathways, certification boundaries, curriculum licensing, institutional implementation, machine-use boundaries, and authorized-use conditions within the SSS / DHFT / SIM / LCB architecture.\n\nRecords in this component define how source-governed materials may be accessed, referenced, licensed, taught, implemented, or authorized. They do not replace, modify, or expand the foundational DHFT source architecture and do not disclose the Structural Identification Method as an implementation manual.\n\nPublic access to materials in this component does not authorize assessment, audit, certification, training, institutional deployment, machine use, practitioner use, teacher training, professional implementation, curriculum licensing, or derivative method development.\n\nAll authorized use requires written authorization through Somatic Rising Institute or the source steward.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
  ],
